      "label": "Puerto Rico addresses are formatted differently than a standard US Address. The",
      "text": "Puerto Rico addresses are formatted differently than a standard US Address. The address formats are specific to the location of the residence, and there are exceptions within these formats. See Knowledge Center for more information on handling addresses in Puerto Rico.",
      "forms": [
        {
          "formId": "Knowledge Center",
          "url": "../Knowledge Center/Knowledge_Center.htm"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "MVRs for Puerto Rico's Insureds are not obtained through the MVR vendor that ser",
      "text": "MVRs for Puerto Rico's Insureds are not obtained through the MVR vendor that services the 50 states. The MVR image that populates in TreX are not reflect a valid MVR. MVRs are provided manually by the firm. For this reason, the MVR requirement must be handled differently for these policies. See the Knowledge Center for more information.",
      "forms": [
        {
          "formId": "Knowledge Center",
          "url": "../Knowledge Center/Knowledge_Center.htm"
        }
      ]
